OL,3,GNEWSAWhy students are being told to
OL,4,Atalk more in class
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a skill that many take for
OL,7,Fgranted but one the government says is
OL,8,Fcentral to success in work and life -
OL,9,Fthe ability to articulate yourself
OL,10,Fconfidently.
OL,12,FOracy is being added to the National
OL,13,FCurriculum and from primary school to
OL,14,FGCSEs students will be taught how to
OL,15,Fspeak, listen and communicate
OL,16,Feffectively.
OL,18,FA Hampshire school is already leading
OL,19,Fthe way and has been named a centre of
OL,20,Fexcellence. Mount Pleasant Schools in
OL,21,FSouthampton has been teaching Oracy to
OL,22,Fits pupils for seven years.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
